    "The specification table prints Aperture Range 5 alongside the actual F2.8–F16 range. This appears to be a mislabeled blade-count entry, but five blades are not asserted without an unambiguous source; the linked manual could not be retrieved. Aperture click behavior remains unconfirmed.",
